      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cedar_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1973 archaeologists uncovered the Wilson‑Leonard site, a Paleo‑Indian camp that shows continuous habitation of the Cedar Park area since about 10,000 BCE.",
